  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TB Free Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the TB Free Uzbekistan Activity is to achieve 2027 national/United Nations High Level Meeting (UNHML) tuberculosis targets through optimized reach, cure, prevent and sustain technical area interventions which will expand high quality, people-centered, affordable, and integrated TB-related health activities with robust national and sub-national health systems.</narrative>
  </description>
